&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full new business cycle within mid-market accounts (51–500 employees) — hunting for new logos, not managing existing ones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build your pipeline through outbound prospecting, target account strategies, and close collaboration with your BDR partner&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run deals end-to-end — from first outreach through discovery, demo, negotiation, and close — typically $40K+ ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate complex, multi-stakeholder deals by coordinating across BDRs, Pre-Sales, executive sponsors, and product specialists&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring HubSpot&#39;s AI-powered customer platform to mid-sized businesses working through real complexity in how they go to market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of full-cycle closing experience with a defined revenue quota&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of net-new business experience — you hunt, you build your own pipeline, and you can walk us through exactly how&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistent tenure throughout your sales career&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of strong quota attainment and upward trajectory — we&#39;ll ask about your numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage a mixed pipeline — keeping transactional deals moving while giving complex, high-value opportunities the attention they deserve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;President&#39;s Club, Rising Star, or comparable recognition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Closing 3–6 deals per month across a mix of deal sizes from $10k-60k ARR&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience closing $40K+ ARR deals with 30–120 day cycles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working within a deal team (BDRs, Pre-Sales, Solutions Engineers, exec sponsors)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with JEPs, MAPs, or structured closing plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling across multiple technology categories or company stages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
