&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeathubspot&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Life at HubSpot on Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you need accommodations or assistance due to a disability, please reach out to us&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://form.asana.com/?k=Xr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q&amp;amp;d=8587152060687&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://form.asana.com/?k%3DXr9-j19kRaY5T5NjIeyx4Q%26d%3D8587152060687&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1699378163995000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw2_XirAqwPzHwePk2ZYcL3q&quot;&gt;using this form&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
