&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;An education allowance up to €4,250 per year and a free books program so you can keep on learning&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
