&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our mission at HubSpot is to help millions of organizations grow better. The Inbound Success Coach (ISC) plays a critical role at the beginning of that journey—engaging with prospective customers, addressing their questions, and identifying potential sales opportunities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll work with a high volume of inbound demand across chat, phone, and web channels, helping businesses understand how HubSpot can support their goals. This is an entry-level role designed to build foundational sales skills, including customer conversations, qualification, and pipeline creation, with a clear path for growth within the Sales organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You are the &lt;strong&gt;first human interaction in the sales process&lt;/strong&gt;, helping prospects navigate their initial experience with HubSpot while identifying and qualifying potential opportunities for the sales team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage a high volume of inbound inquiries from prospects via chat, phone, and web channels&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage prospects in conversations to understand their goals, challenges, resolve their queries, and guiding them toward relevant next steps&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, prioritize, and route high-quality sales opportunities to Account Executives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate consistently in a fast-paced, high-activity environment while maintaining quality across every interaction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Achieve booked meetings rate and meetings to deal rate metrics (targets based on region)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We Are Looking For:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in English&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills, with the ability to engage prospects, guide conversations, and build rapport quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear motivation to start and grow a career in sales, with energy for working toward goals and measurable outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curiosity and a problem-solving mindset when understanding customer needs and business challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort handling a high volume of daily interactions while staying organized and consistent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resilience and adaptability to thrive in fast-paced, performance-driven environments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coachability and a willingness to learn, apply feedback, and continuously improve&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nice to have: additional language (German, French)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like in This Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You perform in a competitive, target-driven, high volume environment.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivation to go above and beyond to achieve goals and metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be proactive and take ownership to drive results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay consistent and resilient while managing a high number of daily interactions, maintaining focus and energy throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be coachable and continuously improve how you qualify and convert opportunities based on feedback and experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where You’ll Work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Location: Dublin, Ireland&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work setup: Flexible or in-office&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Schedule: Monday to Friday. Schedules may shift depending on the market and business needs to support inbound demand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applications must be submitted in English.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Applicants must be currently based and have working rights in Ireland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
